<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>發布貼文 - 𝕯𝖍𝖗𝖊𝖆𝖉𝖘</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #000;
      color: #fff;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    .container {
      display: flex;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    .sidebar {
      width: 280px;
      padding: 20px;
      border-right: 1px solid #2e2e2e;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      height: 100vh;
    }
    .sidebar h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      padding: 10px;
    }
    .nav-item {
      display: block;
      padding: 15px;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 18px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-item:hover { background: #1a1a1a; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 15px;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 18px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: #000;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: left;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .btn:hover { background: #1a1a1a; }
    .main {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 20px;
      max-width: 600px;
      border-right: 1px solid #2e2e2e;
    }
    .page-title {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      padding-bottom: 15px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #2e2e2e;
    }
    .post-form {
      background: #161616;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 25px;
    }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .form-group label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #888;
    }
    .form-group input,
    .form-group textarea {
      width: 100%;
      background: #0a0a0a;
      border: 1px solid #2e2e2e;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 15px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-family: inherit;
    }
    .form-group textarea {
      min-height: 200px;
      resize: vertical;
    }
    .form-group input:focus,
    .form-group textarea:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: #667eea;
    }
    .btn-submit {
      background: #fff;
      color: #000;
      border: none;
      padding: 15px 40px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-submit:hover { transform: scale(1.02); }
    .btn-cancel {
      background: transparent;
      color: #888;
      border: 1px solid #2e2e2e;
      padding: 15px 40px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-left: 10px;
    }
    .btn-cancel:hover { border-color: #fff; color: #fff; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sidebar">
      <h1>𝕯𝖍𝖗𝖊𝖆𝖉𝖘</h1>
      <a href="/" class="nav-item">🏠 首頁</a>
      <a href="/profile" class="nav-item">👤 個人資料</a>
      <a href="/new" class="nav-item active">✏️ 發布貼文</a>
      <form action="/logout" method="GET" style="margin-top: auto;">
        <button type="submit" class="btn">🚪 登出</button>
      </form>
    </div>
    
    <div class="main">
      <h2 class="page-title">發布新貼文</h2>
      <div class="post-form">
        <form action="/new" method="POST">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>標題（可選）</label>
            <input type="text" name="title" placeholder="輸入標題...">
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label>內容（支援 Markdown）</label>
            <textarea name="content" placeholder="分享你的想法...&#10;&#10;支援 Markdown 語法：&#10;# 標題&#10;**粗體**&#10;*斜體*&#10;`程式碼`"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">發布</button>
          <a href="/" class="btn-cancel">取消</a>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
